<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/26/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Civil Aviation Act 1969 [Act 3], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in the national language text, by substituting for the words “padang terbang” the word “aerodrom”, wherever appearing except in the definitions of “padang terbang” and “padang terbang Kerajaan” in section 2. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/26/eng@> .
