<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/26/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 24f of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “one hundred thousand ringgit” the words “five hundred thousand ringgit”. Amendment of section 24k"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/26/eng@> .
